## Model Performance

The model was evaluated on a test set using a Random Forest classifier:

- Accuracy: 82%
- Precision: 81%
- Recall: 78%
- F1-score: 81%

These values reflect results from a real-world dataset of approximately 130,000 samples after an 80/20 training/testing split.

## How to Use

1. Open the `Smart_Phishing_Detector.ipynb` file in Google Colab
2. Upload the required datasets (`malicious_phish.csv`, `whois_data_real_100k.csv`)
3. Run all code cells from top to bottom (Steps 1 to 8)
4. Use the function `check_url("your-url-here")` to test any link

